WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.480
So this is Las Vegas.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:47.620
Las Vegas means 'The Meadows' in Spanish.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:51.460
In the past, it was famous as the city of gambling,

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:57.250
but now it's known as an amusement city, filled with all kinds of pleasures.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:05.600
Wherever I turn, all I see are neon lights shining brightly. It feels like I'm at a party.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.980
And the stadium is somewhere in this city, right?

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.990
Yes! We'll be there in 15 minutes.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:15.650
Alright! The World Tournament is finally here!

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:28.250
The American Tournament Begins!

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:36.160
Here we go.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.900
What a noisy crowd.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:39.800
What's going on?

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.390
Ah, look at that!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.000
I see. I'm looking forward to it.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:50.870
Well then, Mr. Micheal, is there anything you want to say to all the fans of the PPB team around the world?

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:54.400
To all the Beybladers in America,

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:58.580
I, Micheal, want to make a declaration
as the captain of the American team.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:03.630
The PPB definitely won't betray your expectations! We <i>will</i> win!

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.120
Micheal!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.380
So he's the captain of the PPB team, huh.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.720
Thank you for your time.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.850
We're counting on your support!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:17.600
Hey!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:18.880
And you are..?

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.770
I'm Takao from the BBA team.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:23.960
BBA..?

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.940
I told you about them.
They're the ones from the East.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.400
Oh, right.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.400
Let's fight with all we have.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.690
Oh, so you just wanted to greet them.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:41.500
I see, so you are the naive fools who got cocky after defeating our second string players.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.670
What was that?!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.860
We did <i>not</i> get cocky!

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:47.450
You're the Director's son, right?

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.060
Oh, right. I wanted to ask you something.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:57.550
It's something Director Judy keeps telling us, so I'm sure you know about it too.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.470
What does a Beyblader need?

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.380
It's obvious! Hard work and guts!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.560
That's not it.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:07.960
First of all, an innate battle sense.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.800
We have that.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.160
But that alone is not enough.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:23.150
Look at that. We use those machines to collect data and tweak our Beyblades.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.950
There's also a training facility for us in there.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:30.750
Well, this is a smaller version made for when we're on the road.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:36.170
The tremendous power of science and a huge capital  to back up your own innate skills.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:40.680
These are things any Beyblader needs.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:44.680
Still, it doesn't look like
the BBA team has any of that.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:49.520
What do you think you can achieve nowadays only with your hard work and guts?

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.330
I can't agree with that.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:05:00.000
Much more important than those flashy facilities are the hard work and guts Takao mentioned,

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.450
and finally, the feeling of <i>love</i> for your Bey.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.630
Heck yeah! That's right, Max!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:10.050
Foolish. Hard work, guts and...
What was that last one?

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:16.040
Well, we will be watching your match to see how far your way of fighting will take you.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.200
Well, just don't put up an unsightly fight.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.020
What that 'unsightly' supposed to mean?! Huh?!

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.040
Takao!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:27.520
Hey!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:31.290
Calm down! I will not let you
put up an unsightly fight!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:34.050
Leave everything to me.

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:36.390
I have arranged everything.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.120
Arranged..?

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:37.800
Precisely.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.660
Your name is Kai, isn't it?

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.470
Will you be fighting?

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.820
What does that have to do with you?

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.480
You still haven't fought once in America.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.780
So we don't have any data on you.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.530
So you want data about me?

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:55.300
Micheal and the others are only thinking about winning,

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:59.120
but the PPB's original purpose is data gathering for the sake of research.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.500
Foolish.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.000
Well, whatever. If you
decide to fight, do tell me.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.420
Is that so?

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:13.440
You're a huge help.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.170
Oh, please, it's nothing.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:19.240
I came here in advance to fill out the paperwork for Takao and the others,

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:22.150
but those documents read like Arabic to me.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:26.870
I don't know what would have happened if you didn't help me out with that.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:33.400
I should be the one to thank you. I've been relying on you quite a bit since we came to America.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.550
Hey, Mr. Daitenji is here to see yo—

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.920
Heck yeah! Thank you, Professor!

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.580
What's going on?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.040
Look at this, Grandpa!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:51.010
It's the new Bey the Professor built for me!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.800
I call it Dragoon Phantom!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:59.850
It was impossible for the old Dragoon to stand on the same level as the PPB's power.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:03.920
And that is why I developed this new Dragoon.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:08.070
Attack power and launch speed have both been upgraded!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:10.280
Nice timing, Professor!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.700
Alright, I'm gonna do this!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.220
I'm not gonna let those
guys make light of me!

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:19.120
Exactly! We can't let our
training in the woods go to waste!

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:22.480
Also, they brought up my Mama...

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.460
I can't forgive those guys!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:28.870
Hard work, guts, and the
feeling of love for your Bey.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:32.350
Let's show those guys just
how powerful they can be!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:35.040
I see you're all in full spirit.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.720
How reliable.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:45.190
Hey everybody, and thanks for waiting.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.790
The exciting Bey battles are about to start!

00:07:57.380 --> 00:08:03.870
What will take place here is the World tournament's A-Block, also known as the American tournament!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:09.010
All the teams gathered here will fight following the tournament format.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:14.640
The two teams who win every round will fight each other for the championship of the American tournament!

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:21.760
The winning team will earn the right to take part in the final round of the World Tournament!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:30.280
According to the match-ups, we must reach the finals of the American tournament to fight with the PPB team.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:35.020
Well, whatever. We'll just take our fighting spirit out on our first opponents.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:35.690
<i>Yes!</i>

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:39.130
By the way, who's fighting in the first set?

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.160
Rei is going.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.410
Okay!

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:42.880
Wait.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:50.390
Well, then. The first match will be the Mexican team against the BBA team.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:55.620
To fight the first round for
the Mexican team will be Miguel!

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:59.570
And for the opposing BBA team, Rei!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.800
Uh?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:07.360
Oh? A player substitution for the BBA team. Kai will be fighting in place of Rei!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:09.550
Do your best!

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:10.600
I see...

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:13.980
Contact the Director. We have
a chance to get data on Kai.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:18.240
I see. So you too can't forgive the PPB, Kai.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.390
That's not it.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:25.560
They are after my data.
So why don't I give it to them?

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:30.080
Are we clear? We can't lose in the first round.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.760
Let them have a taste of our power.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:34.210
You got it.

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:45.220
The stadium for the preliminaries is based on the setting of many Western movies,

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.360
the Grand Canyon!

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.410
Wilderness with rocks wherever you look.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.520
The rocky mountain will at times will act as a shield for your Bey,

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.630
and at times will become
obstacles that get in your way.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:14.070
I'm Miguel. I'm a mariachi, the singers of Mexico.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.760
I will play the Melody of Death just for you!

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.870
We set up the camera just in time.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:29.070
Is he strong enough for us to want data on him?

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.570
Who knows, we won't know
until we watch his fight.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:32.870
I can't wait.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:37.290
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.040
Three, Two, One!

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.740
Go... Shoot!

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:59.120
Oh, that must be Miguel's signature move, the Melody of Death.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:00.220
Melody of Death?

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.410
Look closely to his Attack Ring.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.720
Something's emitting a sound.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.040
They're guitar chords.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.390
Guitar chords..?

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.730
And not just your average ones.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:16.610
They're stronger than piano wire and won't break under one ton of pressure.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:21.840
I see. Those chords can deflect any kind of attack.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:26.330
So he just waits for the opponent to run out of power while shaking off their attacks.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:31.690
That's right. Every time you attack, your Bey gets closer and closer to its own demise!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.120
While strumming the Melody of Death.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.260
What's so funny?!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.810
I can't have you underestimating Dranzer's power!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:43.880
What?!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.480
<i>You</i> will listen to the melody of death!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.600
I-Impossible! You cut through my chords?!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:07.040
The first set ends with Kai's victory!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.600
I expected nothing less from you, Kai.

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.360
Director.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.200
What is it?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:29.360
It seems our machines can't
measure Dranzer's attack power.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:30.560
Can't measure?

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:36.240
Even if it only lasted an instant, the level of power was just too high.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:37.440
How can that be?!

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:43.440
You fools. As if you could
measure Dranzer's power that easily.

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:45.990
Let's move on to the second set.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.240
The Mexican team sends out Pedro!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.080
And the BBA team sends out Max!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.180
I'm going!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.020
Go get'em.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.230
Kai, you did great out there.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:58.080
Max.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:58.780
What?

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:01.100
Look at the audience seats, in the top left.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.880
Yes, you're right.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:06.890
Mama..!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.680
Well then, let's go back.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.050
Aren't you going to watch the other matches?

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:11.850
Why would I?

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:17.420
I admit that Kai is formidable, but we already know everything about the other BBA players.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:19.750
No point in even checking them out.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.860
I'd rather train in the trailer.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.400
What about you, Director?

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.840
I will stay.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:31.320
We already set up the camera. And having more data surely can't hurt.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.580
Well, don't let me stop you.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.700
Director.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:37.310
What?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:42.460
Are you sure you're not staying because you're worried about Max?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.550
I'm only staying to gather data.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.850
My name is Pedro.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:54.480
My father is the number one matador in Mexico, and his blood runs in my veins!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.150
This won't go like Miguel's fight!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.400
<i>Okay!</i> I'm going to do my best, too.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.720
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:10.480
Mama's PPB team keeps
making fun of our team,

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.630
but I will show them our true power!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.960
Three, Two, One!

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.240
Go... Shoot!

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:34.640
Why aren't you coming at me? At this rate, I won't be able to show Mama my power!

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.560
This is my way of fighting!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:51.700
Look out!

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:07.760
No! Draciel's Body is scratched!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.990
That Attack Ring is increibly powerful.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.250
Our best bet is to drag it out
and wait for him to stop.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:20.820
No. Looking at that Bey's design, I can tell it has more resistance than Draciel.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:22.080
What?!

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:25.420
If we don't go on the
offensive, we can't win!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:28.480
But will Max be able to dodge that Attack Ring?

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:29.640
This is it.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.140
I guess this is all his level of power could get him.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.520
At this rate..!

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:40.180
When a matador fights a bull, he takes him down in one single strike!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:44.370
In the same way, I will cut down your Bey in a single move! Now, come at me!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.610
I can't attack, and I can't wait it out.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.160
What should I do..?

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:53.170
I know! Alright, it's all or nothing!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:54.210
Draciel!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.480
Is he going to attack?

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.440
That's reckless!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.190
This is it!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.220
W-What?!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.920
My Draciel is not that weak!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.800
His balance is not just for show!

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.860
Go, Draciel!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.370
No way!

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:32.100
It's over! The winner is Max! The BBA team advances to the next round!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.160
Okay.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.720
We did it! We did it!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.860
Alright!

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:39.680
Mama!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.030
What?

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.080
No, nothing.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:47.150
I'm sorry, captain. Because of me...

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.790
That's enough.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:56.790
It's finally time for the third set.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:59.650
Cabon against Takao.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.390
Will the Mexican team turn the tides?

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.930
Takao is next.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:07.740
We already analyzed his data.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:11.030
There's no need to gather more data on him.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.260
You have a point.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.270
Director!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.030
That's... A new Bey?!

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.280
I'll take note.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.010
Yes, do.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.760
This is the debut match of the new Dragoon.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.100
Takao, don't lose!

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:41.190
It seems like we underestimated
you. I should have gone first.

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:44.870
My ancestors were Mexico's greatest gunmen.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.360
Oh? You sound pretty confident.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.750
I guess you must be quite strong.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.670
Scared?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.120
No, I'm excited!

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:53.130
Very well.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.630
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:00.040
Three, Two, One!

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.950
Go... Shoot!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:13.870
Alright, the launch speed has definitely improved.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.360
Go!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:27.010
Interesting! Dragoon,
let's show him our power!

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:29.110
I won't hold back. This is the end!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:34.060
Taste my secret technique, the Gatling Attack!

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.250
Here we go!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.060
W-What's with that attack?!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:53.940
Gatling Attack... The gatling gun was used during the Mexican revolution.

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:59.530
By attacking consecutively, it assures that the opponent will be thoroughly destroyed.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:03.250
Will Takao be able to endure
that attack with his new Bey?

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.340
I wonder.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:12.000
The PPB's Beys are another matter, but Takao's Bey might not have what it takes to resist the Gatling Attack.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:13.400
Professor!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.130
No, it will be fine!

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:17.320
Dragoon!

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:57.330
The winner of the third set is Takao!

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:06.060
That Bey... It was able to shatter the Gatling Attack!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:07.730
I can't believe this..!

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:11.030
Thank you, Professor!

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:11.950
Takao!

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.990
This was an adequate
start to the American tournament.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:18.640
Alright! Let's keep this up
until we get to fight the PPB!

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:19.940
Yeah!

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:25.000
Director, according to our
data, the BBA team is E-class.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.960
They were the lowest level.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:27.840
Yes.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.830
We should adjust our analysis.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:31.920
That won't be necessary.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.680
What was the Mexican team's rank?

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:35.920
C-class.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:41.420
Undefined elements such as Kai's presence and Takao's new Bey

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:46.000
might make it possible for an E-class team to defeat a C-class one.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:49.930
But what's the result of our
analysis of the PPB team?

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.190
We're A-class.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:57.040
In other words, it's 100% impossible for them to win against us.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.190
No matter what kind
of miracle may happen.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:00.720
Yes!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:01.430
Let's go back.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:13.950
It would have been
better for you to lose now.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.590
Max...

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:23.670
If you were to face off against the PPB team, the only thing waiting for you will be pain and humiliation.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.340 --> 00:23:03.440
According to my analysis our next opponents, the Ecuadorian team, is impossible to analyze.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:09.520
Of course they are. They're a mysterious group, the only one that even the PPB is scared of fighting.

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:11.430
What's so mysterious, you ask?

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:17.620
It's the fact that they're huge idiots, and nobody ever knows what they're thinking!

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:21.240
Next time: American Hero, Micheal's Power.

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:24.400
You guys, will you stop fooling around?!
